## ASSET ÜRETİMİ (Kod yazmadan önce)

### Asset 1 — CNC Sequence (Ana Scrollytelling)

**Start Frame Prompt (Kling AI / Runway / Sora):**
```
Ultra-premium industrial photography of a raw aluminum billet block
placed on a matte black surface. Deep black background with subtle
gradient falloff, soft rim lighting tracing the block edges and
machine marks. Cinematic lighting, high contrast, engineering
aesthetic, sharp focus. No text, no logos. Shot with 85mm lens,
f/1.8, ultra-high resolution, photorealistic, Apple-level product
shoot, dramatic mood.
```

**End Frame Prompt:**
```
Exploded technical diagram view of a finished precision CNC-machined
aluminum aerospace bracket, every component and internal geometry
precisely separated and floating in perfect alignment, suspended
mid-air against a deep black studio background. Visible internal
structure including threaded holes, tolerance surfaces, chamfers,
and material grain. Hyper-realistic product visualization,
ultra-sharp focus, studio rim lighting identical to the hero shot.
Cinematic lighting, high contrast, luxury engineering aesthetic.
No labels, no annotations, no text. Photorealistic, ultra-high
resolution, Apple-style industrial design render.
```

**Motion Prompt:**
```
Smoothly transition from the raw aluminum billet to the finished
exploded precision CNC part. The material transforms and the
geometry assembles then disassembles. Slow motion, 6 seconds.
```

**Frame Extraction (ffmpeg):**
```bash
ffmpeg -i cnc_sequence.mp4 -vf fps=20 -q:v 2 public/sequence-cnc/frame_%04d.jpg
# Hedef: ~120 frame, her biri ~50-80KB (WebP ile)
# WebP dönüşüm:
for f in public/sequence-cnc/*.jpg; do
  cwebp -q 80 "$f" -o "${f%.jpg}.webp"
done
```

