### 3.3 Machine Loop Background (Hizmetler Hero)

```tsx
<video
  src="/machine-loop.mp4"
  autoPlay loop muted playsInline
  className="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover opacity-15"
  style={{ mixBlendMode: "luminosity" }}
/>
// İçerik z-10, video z-0
// IntersectionObserver ile viewport'a girince play(), çıkınca pause()
// preload="none" — lazy load
// Mobilde: video yüklenmez (bant genişliği tasarrufu)
```

