## PACKAGE.JSON EKLENTİLERİ

```json
{
  "dependencies": {
    "@studio-freight/react-lenis": "^1.0.14"
  }
}
```

Three.js, Framer Motion, Recharts zaten mevcut — ek paket gerekmez.
